status GREEN -- remember_git_nib_write 34/0 on metal, index_row_bound ok, render agrees with git and the card
recommend keep-going -- the shelf-order writer is the same four-file shape one pin over and the instrument for it already exists in index_row_bound_scan.sh; it is %440's holder's booked lap, so the next BAKERY lap takes the .rye compile-reach census witness instead, which is measured and wants only its pen.
